S10 Phase-I BEV pooling operator

This directory contains an independent PyTorch extension integration derived from
the BEV pooling algorithm and CUDA implementation in MIT HAN Lab BEVFusion commit
326653dc06e0938edf1aae7d01efcd158ba83de5.

Upstream project: https://github.com/mit-han-lab/bevfusion
Upstream files: mmdet3d/ops/bev_pool/
Upstream license: Apache License 2.0

Copyright 2022 MIT HAN Lab contributors.
Modifications include fail-closed dtype/shape checks, modern PyTorch extension
bindings, stable Python-side geometry ordering, empty-input handling, build/source
identity reporting, and explicit CUDA launch checks.
